+# Profile pictures (users + organizations) are stored in Active Storage.
+#
+# `ImageUploader.store_name` resolves which of the services below a Forem
+# instance uses for its profile pictures (`store_name`, or `amazon` for the
+# instances that ship a FOREM_OWNER_SECRET) and falls back to the service
+# configured for the environment (`config.active_storage.service`) when the
+# instance has not declared one, which is what local development, CI and
+# self-hosted single node installs do.
+#
+# Managed instances write to their own bucket instead and declare the matching
+# service here. The S3 adapter needs the `aws-sdk-s3` gem, so uncomment the
